  H3 secZ <= -1.0                  (1) Era 2 PASS, early stand-in fail, Era 1 MISSING | (2) Era 3 PASS | (3) sleeve fail -> FAILS
  H3b secZ <= -1.2                 (1) Era 2 PASS, early stand-in fail, Era 1 MISSING | (2) Era 3 PASS | (3) sleeve fail -> FAILS
  H4 RSI14 <= 25 & volz > 1        (1) Era 2 fail, early stand-in fail, Era 1 MISSING | (2) Era 3 fail | (3) sleeve fail -> FAILS
  combined (ms+secZ+acc+preMom)    (1) Era 2 PASS, early stand-in fail, Era 1 MISSING | (2) Era 3 PASS | (3) sleeve fail -> FAILS
  combined + ML >= 50%             (1) Era 2 PASS, early stand-in n/a, Era 1 MISSING | (2) Era 3 fail | (3) sleeve fail -> FAILS
  V1 live rule, Capitulation Score order                     sleeve rule (3): fail
  V0 + 6-ATR stop, 40-session cooldown                       sleeve rule (3): fail
  V0 + -25% stop, 40-session cooldown                        sleeve rule (3): fail

